$ CBUSH of nonzero length with a continuation entry that has OCID = -1 and a blank S. Blank S means the default 0.5
$ (spring at the midpoint). The bug read it as 0 (spring at GA).
SOL 101
CEND
SPC = 1
LOAD = 1
DISP = ALL
BEGIN BULK
GRID,1,,0.,0.,0.
GRID,2,,2.,1.,0.5
CBUSH,1,1,1,2,0.,0.,1.,,+B1
+B1,,-1
PBUSH,1,K,1000.,2000.,3000.,4000.,5000.,6000.
SPC1,1,123456,1
FORCE,1,2,,1.,1.,2.,3.
MOMENT,1,2,,1.,.4,.5,.6
ENDDATA
